      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd still go with \"Quests\". One of the most memorable things I remember from the OASIS in RPO was quests. For example, you if you complete the \"Back to the Future\" quest, you get the DeLorean car as a reward. In my opinion, VRChat needs to let players use props with custom scripting or whatever Udon is going to provide us with. And yes, in case you're familiar with my ideas, this is yet another comment about the inventory system.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
